*  RED WITNESS (s137) — THE BEAUTY SELF-HOST BLOCKER, MINIMAL.
*  ARBNO whose deferred body CONTAINS A NESTED DEFER, taken for TWO iterations.
*  One ingredient away from m1_arbno_nested_defer_grn.sno (which passes): the body's inner *Sp.
*  ONE iteration passes; the SECOND iteration is where it fails -- the re-entrant
*  ζ-ACTIVATION-FRAME class (a *P defer inside a retried ARBNO re-enters its own frame).
*  Provenance: beauty.sno:225  Parse = nPush() ARBNO(*Command) (...) nPop()  with Command
*  recursive, reached from beauty.sno:611  Src POS(0) *Parse *Space RPOS(0).
*  SPITBOL manual Ch.9 p.121: "Each time ARBNO is retried, it supplies another instance of its
*  argument pattern" -- instance TWO is the one with no home.  Oracle: SPITBOL x64 sbl -b.
         &ANCHOR      =  1
         L            =  SPAN('ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ')
         Sp           =  SPAN(' ') | LEN(0)
         C2           =  L *Sp
         'START HERE' POS(0) ARBNO(*C2) RPOS(0)                    :F(F1)
         OUTPUT       =  'ok'                                      :(END)
F1       OUTPUT       =  'FAIL'
END
